            "review_title": "Review at East Borough Pizza",
            "review_text": "Kim H\nLos Angeles, California124 contributions\n1\nBest Pizza in Saigon\nJan 2025 • Couples\nSaigon has a surprising pizza scene and this place is new and has already become my favorite pizza place. It is in Bin Thanh (newer Japantown) across from D1 and Old Japantown. There are so many bars in this area and perfect spot to grab a slice or a whole pie. It is new so limited selection.... But the pepperoni paired with Tra Vui (Vietnamese hard tea cocktail) is amazing.\nRead more\nWritten January 22, 2025",
